From 0e2b42477c5c6e904f55e0112b4b9c51be8c72ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dev <dev@perseus>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 09:36:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 02/12] Mixed-size modulus chains (Lattigo-style bootstrap
 segment)

- CCParams::SetScalingModSizePerLevel: per-level rescale-prime bit sizes
  (empty = uniform, byte-identical)
- MixedPrimeModuliGen: segment-aware FLEXIBLEAUTO prime selection
- PrecomputeCRTTables: segment-aware scaling-factor table (ascending reset,
  descending geometric descent), data-driven from the actual prime ladder
- MakeAuxPlaintext: encode CtS/StC stage plaintexts at sf[l+1]*q_drop/sf[l]
  (boundary-gated; uniform chains keep the original value bit-identically)
- EvalBootstrap: eager final rescale on mixed chains (deg-1 on-table output)
- btsTrace stage tracing under OPENFHE_BTS_TRACE=1
